               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Assessment of the results of the study by McCann et al. (2007) on the effect of some colours and sodium benzoate on children&amp;#x0027;s behaviour [1] &amp;#x2010; Scientific Opinion of the Panel on Food Additives, Flavourings, Processing Aids and Food Contact Materials (AFC)</rdf:li>
